    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Pure PGN Viewer is designed for chess enthusiasts who want a clean, modern way to display chess games.</p>\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong><br />\n* <strong>Stockfish Integration:</strong> Real-time evaluation bar.<br />\n* <strong>Modern UI:</strong> Dark mode with player badges.<br />\n* <strong>Clean Layout:</strong> No text-wrapping (floats) for a stable block design.<br />\n* <strong>Tested:</strong> Fully compatible with WordPress 6.9.</p>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>2.0.8</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>New: Full compatibility update for WordPress 6.9.</li>\n<li>Fixed: Improved block layout to prevent text wrapping.</li>\n<li>Fixed: Enhanced CSS for better theme integration.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "A minimalist, high-performance PGN viewer for WordPress. Features a built-in Stockfish engine, dark mode, and improved block alignment.",
